hub_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2887780016/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-05-16T22:24:21Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2887780016","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nHi!\n\nI'm facing an error that I believe looks like a bug.\n\n`jax.lax.with_sharding_constraint` raises an `XlaRuntimeError` error when called with an Array of PRNG keys inside a `jit`ed function.\n\n```python\nimport jax\nimport jax.random as jrd\nimport jax.sharding as jshard\n\nnum_devices = len(jax.devices())  # 2 GPUs in my case\nmesh = jax.make_mesh((num_devices,), (\"batch\",))\nsharded = jshard.NamedSharding(mesh, jshard.PartitionSpec(\"batch\"))\n\nbatch_size = 64\nkey = jrd.key(0)\nbatch_key, key = jrd.split(key, 2)\nkey_batch = jrd.split(batch_key, batch_size)\n\nkey_batch = jax.device_put(key_batch, sharded)\n\n@jax.jit\ndef fun1(_key_batch):\n    uniform = jax.vmap(jax.random.uniform)(_key_batch)\n    uniform = jax.lax.with_sharding_constraint(uniform, sharded)\n    return uniform\n\n@jax.jit\ndef fun2(_key_batch):\n    _key_batch = jax.lax.with_sharding_constraint(_key_batch, sharded)  # error is raised here\n    uniform = jax.vmap(jax.random.uniform)(_key_batch)\n    uniform = jax.lax.with_sharding_constraint(uniform, sharded)\n    return uniform\n\nuni1 = fun1(key_batch)  # works\n\nuni2 = fun2(key_batch)  # raises jaxlib.xla_extension.XlaRuntimeError: UNKNOWN: <unknown>:0: error: Number of tile assignment dimensions (excluding subgroups) is different than the input rank. sharding={devices=[2]<=[2]}, input_shape=u32[64,2]\n```\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\njax:    0.5.0\njaxlib: 0.5.0\nnumpy:  2.2.3\npython: 3.11.11 (main, Dec 11 2024, 16:28:39) [GCC 11.2.0]\ndevice info: Tesla V100-SXM2-32GB-2, 2 local devices\"\nprocess_count: 1\nplatform: uname_result(system='Linux', node='bigfoot5', release='5.10.0-28-amd64', version='#1 SMP Debian 5.10.209-2 (2024-01-31)', machine='x86_64')\n```","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":3,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/27223/comments","created_at":"2025-03-18T18:25:34Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/27223/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/27223","id":2929484964,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/27223/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc6unGSk","number":27223,"pe